# Route contract matrix. Columns: route | success | 401 | 403 | 400 | 404 | 409
# An error-status cell is either that exact status or `N/A: <clear rationale>`.

# Analytics
GET /api/analytics/overview|200|401|403|400|N/A: aggregate endpoint has no individual resource lookup|N/A: read-only aggregate does not mutate state
GET /api/analytics/work-queue|200|401|403|N/A: endpoint accepts no client request data|N/A: aggregate endpoint has no individual resource lookup|N/A: read-only aggregate does not mutate state
GET /api/analytics/organization|200|401|403|400|N/A: aggregate endpoint has no individual resource lookup|N/A: read-only aggregate does not mutate state
GET /api/analytics/leaders|200|401|403|400|N/A: aggregate endpoint has no individual resource lookup|N/A: read-only aggregate does not mutate state
GET /api/analytics/courses|200|401|403|400|N/A: aggregate endpoint has no individual resource lookup|N/A: read-only aggregate does not mutate state
GET /api/analytics/certificates|200|401|403|400|N/A: aggregate endpoint has no individual resource lookup|N/A: read-only aggregate does not mutate state

# Authentication and session
POST /api/auth/login|200|401|N/A: public login endpoint has no permission gate|400|N/A: invalid credentials must not expose account existence|N/A: login does not create a persistent conflict
POST /api/auth/refresh|200|401|N/A: public refresh endpoint has no permission gate|N/A: refresh token is read from a cookie rather than a request body|N/A: invalid refresh tokens are reported as unauthorized|N/A: refresh does not create a persistent conflict
POST /api/auth/logout|200|N/A: idempotent logout succeeds even when no valid session remains|N/A: public logout endpoint has no permission gate|N/A: refresh token is read from a cookie rather than a request body|N/A: missing or invalid refresh cookie is treated as already logged out|N/A: logout is idempotent and does not create a persistent conflict
GET /api/auth/me|200|401|N/A: authenticated caller needs no additional permission|N/A: endpoint accepts no client request data|N/A: current authenticated account is resolved from the session|N/A: read-only endpoint does not mutate state
POST /api/auth/change-password|200|401|N/A: authenticated caller changes only its own password|400|N/A: current authenticated account is resolved from the session|N/A: password change has no uniqueness conflict
GET /api/auth/admin/summary|200|401|403|N/A: endpoint accepts no client request data|N/A: summary is scoped to the authenticated administrator|N/A: read-only endpoint does not mutate state

